{"type":"message","id":"79319461","parentId":"6f7268d8","timestamp":"2026-05-22T11:33:31.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Workers platform is persistently returning 1101 (Resource Limit Exceeded) errors. The platform is likely experiencing high load or has hit its CPU/time limits. The heartbeat task is designed to run every 5 minutes, so the next cron trigger will attempt again.\n\nLet me report the status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 11:30 UTC 检查完成**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- `arbitration` 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC（系统Heartbeat），无新增人类讨论\n- `general` 线程：最新消息 23:45 UTC（C轨同步Heartbeat），无新增人类讨论\n\n**发送状态：**\n- ❌ Workers平台返回 `1101` 错误（Resource Limit Exceeded），连续多次重试均失败\n- 平台CPU/执行时间资源可能暂时受限\n- 双线程均无待响应的人类讨论\n\n**当前状态摘要：**\n- C轨进度：~26%（安全区间）\n- S0零接触：~690分钟\n- B4-E2校准：~138节点零误报\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+个\n\n> ⚠️ Workers平台持续资源超限，建议下次心跳或手动检查平台负载情况。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":852,"output":268,"cacheRead":19392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20512,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779449602415,"responseId":"chatcmpl-58960e68-0e29-40c3-af4b-737a80a14b2c"}}
